{
 "episode": "Q.01",
 "slug": "the-mountain",
 "fps": 30,
 "sampleRate": 48000,
 "voiceSeconds": 75.74,
 "durationSeconds": 78.74,
 "durationInFrames": 2363,
 "endCardStart": 75.74,
 "beats": [
  {
   "id": "b01",
   "scene": "S1",
   "text": "Why would God ask *this*?",
   "start": 0.222,
   "end": 1.538,
   "wordStart": 0,
   "wordEnd": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b02",
   "scene": "S1",
   "text": "The first time the Bible says *love*\u2026 a father is told to give up his *son*.",
   "start": 2.02,
   "end": 6.519,
   "wordStart": 5,
   "wordEnd": 20
  },
  {
   "id": "b03",
   "scene": "S2",
   "text": "\"Take now thy son, thine only son Isaac, whom thou *lovest*\u2026\"",
   "start": 6.96,
   "end": 10.71,
   "wordStart": 21,
   "wordEnd": 31
  },
  {
   "id": "b04",
   "scene": "S3",
   "text": "It sounds nothing like *love*. But most people miss *three* details.",
   "start": 11.17,
   "end": 15.08,
   "wordStart": 32,
   "wordEnd": 42
  },
  {
   "id": "b05",
   "scene": "S4",
   "text": "On the *third day*, Abraham saw the mountain, far off.",
   "start": 15.561,
   "end": 18.619,
   "wordStart": 43,
   "wordEnd": 52
  },
  {
   "id": "b06",
   "scene": "S5",
   "text": "But notice what he told his servants: \"I and the lad will go yonder and worship, and *come again* to you.\"",
   "start": 19.5,
   "end": 25.67,
   "wordStart": 53,
   "wordEnd": 73
  },
  {
   "id": "b07",
   "scene": "S5",
   "text": "*We* will come back. Abraham believed God could raise Isaac\u2026 even from the *dead*.",
   "start": 26.11,
   "end": 31.229,
   "wordStart": 74,
   "wordEnd": 87
  },
  {
   "id": "b08",
   "scene": "S6",
   "text": "Detail two: Isaac carried the *wood* up the hill, and asked, \"Where is the *lamb* for a burnt offering?\"",
   "start": 31.69,
   "end": 37.73,
   "wordStart": 88,
   "wordEnd": 106
  },
  {
   "id": "b09",
   "scene": "S6",
   "text": "\"My son, God will *provide* himself a *lamb*\u2026\"",
   "start": 38.131,
   "end": 40.709,
   "wordStart": 107,
   "wordEnd": 114
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "scene": "S7",
   "text": "At the top, God *stopped* Abraham's hand.",
   "start": 41.151,
   "end": 44.029,
   "wordStart": 115,
   "wordEnd": 121
  },
  {
   "id": "b11",
   "scene": "S8",
   "text": "Detail three: a ram, caught in a thicket\u2026 died *in his place*.",
   "start": 44.47,
   "end": 48.36,
   "wordStart": 122,
   "wordEnd": 133
  },
  {
   "id": "b12",
   "scene": "S9",
   "text": "About two thousand years later, another *Son* carried *wood* on His back\u2026 to Golgotha.",
   "start": 49.24,
   "end": 54.419,
   "wordStart": 134,
   "wordEnd": 147
  },
  {
   "id": "b13",
   "scene": "S10",
   "text": "This time, there was no ram. And God did *not* stop it.",
   "start": 54.901,
   "end": 58.28,
   "wordStart": 148,
   "wordEnd": 159
  },
  {
   "id": "b14",
   "scene": "S10",
   "text": "\"He that *spared not* his own Son, but delivered him up for us all\u2026\"",
   "start": 58.64,
   "end": 62.389,
   "wordStart": 160,
   "wordEnd": 173
  },
  {
   "id": "b15",
   "scene": "S11",
   "text": "That mountain was a *picture* of what God would do\u2026 for *you*.",
   "start": 62.89,
   "end": 66.199,
   "wordStart": 174,
   "wordEnd": 185
  },
  {
   "id": "b16",
   "scene": "S11",
   "text": "The lamb Abraham promised\u2026 was *Jesus*.",
   "start": 66.701,
   "end": 69.379,
   "wordStart": 186,
   "wordEnd": 191
  },
  {
   "id": "b17",
   "scene": "S12",
   "text": "Abraham's *faith*, or God's *love*: which one hits you harder? Tell us in the comments.",
   "start": 69.9,
   "end": 75.03,
   "wordStart": 192,
   "wordEnd": 206
  }
 ],
